## How to Add Requirements

### Automatic Capture (Preferred)

Use the `/capture` skill when requirements are clarified:

```
/capture
Knowledge: {Requirement statement}
Category: spec
```

The skill will add to the appropriate section without duplicating content.

### Format Guidelines

**Functional Requirements:**
```markdown
- **{Feature}**: {What it must do}
  - Acceptance: {How to verify}
```

**Business Rules:**
```markdown
- **{Rule Name}**: {Rule statement}
  - When: {Condition}
  - Then: {Outcome}
```

**User Stories:**
```markdown
- As a {role}, I want {capability} so that {benefit}
  - Acceptance: {Criteria}
```

